<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>DevOps Engineer | Profile</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>JESPER_DOTE<span class="cursor"></span></h1>
            <div class="subtitle">Senior DevOps Engineer | SRE | Cloud Architect</div>
        </header>

        <main>
            <section>
                <h2>About</h2>
                <p>
                    Orchestrating chaos into stability. I specialize in building resilient infrastructure, 
                    optimizing CI/CD pipelines, and ensuring 99.99% availability.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Stack</h2>
                <div class="stack-grid">
                    <div class="terminal-card">
                        <h3>[ Infrastructure ]</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Kubernetes / Helm</li>
                            <li>Terraform / Ansible</li>
                            <li>AWS / GCP</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div class="terminal-card">
                        <h3>[ CI/CD & Observability ]</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>GitHub Actions / Jenkins</li>
                            <li>Prometheus / Grafana</li>
                            <li>ELK Stack</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Connect</h2>
                <div class="btn-group">
                    <a href="https://github.com/jesperdote" class="btn">GitHub</a>
                    <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jesperdote/" class="btn">LinkedIn</a>
                    <a href="#" class="btn">Resume.pdf</a>
                </div>
            </section>
        </main>

        <footer>
            <p>root@server:~$ uptime</p>
            <p> 10:00:01 up 420 days, 1 user, load average: 0.00, 0.01, 0.05</p>
        </footer>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
